# Local render fixtures. The Playwright harness used to drop a PLAINTEXT copy of the operator's
# trade ledger here so the unlocked shell could be driven without a password. It is scratch, it is
# never published, and it must never be committed — it carries analyst names, entries and stops
# that the whole desk encrypts everywhere else. Ignored so a stray `git add -A` cannot take it.
stocks/data/_*preview*.json
silver/data/_*preview*.json
